    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Babaandu ba baamenya mu Yerusalemu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babemeelesi be babaandu baba bamenya mu Yerusalemu. Ne babaandu babaandi baapa chikura khurobora omundu mulala khukhwama mu buli babaandu likhumi bache bamenye mu lukoba lwa Yerusalemu, lukoba lutakatifu. Ne tisa babarama bamenya mu chingoba chabwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babaandu babiita chikhabi abo babeaana khumenya mu Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NEH.7.73"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Neh. 7.73",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Abano nibo babemeelesi be birekere ba baamenya mu Yerusalemu: Balala bamenya mu mikuunda kiabwe mungoba cha Yuda: Baisiraeli, basaayi, Balawi, bakholi be mu Lukaangu ne lisaaye lie bakholi ba Solomoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lisaaye liliindi lia Yuda ne Benjamini liamenya mu Yerusalemu. Be kholo eya Yuda baba: Ataya, okhwa Usia. Ne Usia aba okhwa Sakaria. Sakaria aba okhwa Amaria. Amaria aba okhwa Shefatia, omwana owa Mahaluleli. Mahaluleli aba lisaaye lia Peresi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maaseya aba okhwa Baruku lundi omwichukhulu owa Kolihose. Ne Kolihose aba okhwa Hasaya. Hasaya aba okhwa Adaia okhwa Yoyaribu. Yoyaribu aba okhwa Sakaria, khukhwama e Sheela.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lisaaye lia Peresi liliamenya mu Yerusalemu lioosi liaba chimia chine ne kamakhumi sita na munaane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Be kholo eya Benjamini baba: Salu okhwa Meshulamu lundi omwichukhulu owa Yoedi. Yoedi aba okhwa Pedaya. Pedaya aba okhwa Kolaya. Maaseya aba okhwa Itieli ne Itieli aba okhwa Yeshaya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babaloondakililakho baba Sabai ne Salai, balebe be aembi Salu. Boosi alala, Babenjamini baba chimia tisa ne kamakhumi kabili na munaane ba baamenya mu Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoeli okhwa Sikiri aba omwimeelesi wabwe, ne Yuda okhwa Hasenua aba omwimeelesi Omukhulu owa khabili mu bwimeelesi bwe lukoba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basaayi babengila mu Yerusalemu baba: Yedaya okhwa Yoyaribu ne Yakini, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sereya okhwa Hilikia lundi omwichukhulu owa Meshulamu. Meshulamu aba okhwa Satoki, Satoki aba okhwa Merayo, ne Merayo aba okhwa Ahitubu, owaba Omusaayi Omukhulu Lukali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babao balebe babwe babaandi babakholanga munju eya Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi. Baba boosi chimia munaane ne kamakhumi kabili na babili. Babaandi baba Adaia okhwa Yerohamu lundi omwichukhulu owa Pelalia. Pelalia aba okhwa Amushi, Amushi aba okhwa Sakaria, Sakaria aba okhwa Pashuri, ne Pashuri aba okhwa Malichiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balebe bewe boosi babemeelela chinju baba chimia chibili ne kamakhumi kane na babili. Lundi abao Amashisai okhwa Asareli omwichukhulu owa Asai. Asai aba okhwa Meshilemoti ne Meshilemoti aba okhwa Imeri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alala ne bawandaaye, boosi baba babaandu emia ndala ne kamakhumi kabili na munaane, banamae be kamaani. Omwimeelesi wabwe aaba Sabudieli okhwa Hakedolimu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balawi baba: Shemaya okhwa Hasubu lundi omwichukhulu owa Asirikamu. Asirikamu aba okhwa Hashabia ne Hashabia aba okhwa Buni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shabetai ne Yosabati, baba Balawi bakhulu babemeelelanga kimilimo kie mu Lukaangu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abao lundi Matania okhwa Mika. Mika aba okhwa Sabuti lundi omwichukhulu owa Asafu. Arangiriranga babembi be kimienya mu Lukaangu mu lisaba lie lisiima. Oloondela Matania, aba Bakibukia. Lundi abao Abuda, okhwa Shamu lundi omwichukhulu owa Kalali, lisaaye lia Yedutuni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balawi chimia chibili ne kamakhumi munaane na bane bamenya mu lukoba lutakatifu lwa Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babemeelesi be bilibwa bie Lukaangu baba: Akubu, Talimoni, ne balebe babwe. Boosi alala baba emia ndala ne kamakhumi saba na babili.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baisiraeli babaandi ne basaayi, ne Balawi babarama, bamenya mu mikuunda kiabwe mu chingoba choosi cha Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakholi be mu Lukaangu bamenya abuundu alaangwa Ofeli mu Yerusalemu asi owa siha ne Kishipa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
